p so ah so it is this  is this is the context in which I I Came  Upon This advice so uh this senior uh he  was so I was in second year he was in  third year uh his name uh is nirmalia  sengupta okay so I just uh so just  starting this video five minutes before  this uh I looked up uh nehemalia where  he is now uh it turns out that he is one  of the co-founders of a company called  interested dot one so they are uh they  are looking into innovative ways of  training uh children uh children  including teenagers also  so some kind of after school activities  and various Innovative things so that's  interesting so it's actually  particularly interesting because uh he's  doing this now and I got some kind of  advice some kind of academic advice from  him back then  now what was the advice  so really understand the importance of  this you have to uh you have to  understand that we have uh in our campus  a lot of extracurricular activities and  there's something called the technology  students gym Khanna which is like the  like the governing body for everything  related to Student Activities and there  is a lot of official posts which the  students hold these are extremely busy  posts like all throughout the year the  students have to do a lot of work those  who hold this post and uh nirmalia  sengupta he was one of the general  secretaries holding the post of the  General Secretary of social cultural  activities uh  and this was extremely loaded okay so  this is the overall context and uh what  he told me is as follows he said look  jivan  I am the G6 General Secretary of social  cultural activities  I don't have any time  okay uh forget so you so he is telling  me that you are worried about not being  able to spend enough time on your  studies look at me so he's telling to me  look at me I don't have time to stay in  my room forget staying in my room and  even relaxing forget studying I don't  even get time to sleep some days so  there have been ABS actually stretches  o